            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Margie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We didn’t let it set. It was so good warm with ice cream! I used 1/4 cup maple syrup instead of the sugar and added 1/2 tablespoon of cornstarch. Also added two tablespoons of butter to the mixture. Husband loved it! I will make again and again. Simple and delicious. Thank you!",
